<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>工作堆積如山，不如先去釜山</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "微軟正黑體", sans-serif;
  background: #fafafa;
}

header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.container {
  padding: 20px;
}

.day {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.day h2 {
  color: #ff6f91;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

/* 卡片排版 */
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px,1fr));
  gap: 15px;
}

/* 卡片 */
.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 15px;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: black;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);
}

.card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 170px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.card-content {
  padding: 12px;
}

.title {
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #ff6f91;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}

/* 小標籤 */
.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #ffe4ec;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 5px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
🧚‍♀️ Jocelyn的釜山旅行
</header>

<div class="container">

<!-- Day 1 -->
<div class="day">
<h2>Day 1：海雲台</h2>

<div class="grid">

<a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=海雲台" target="_blank">
<img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?busan,beach">
<div class="card-content">
<div class="title">🌊 海雲台</div>
<div>散步＋看海</div>
<div class="tag">景點</div>
</div>
</a>

<a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=釜山豬肉湯飯" target="_blank">
<img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?korean,food">
<div class="card-content">
<div class="title">🍜 豬肉湯飯</div>
<div>必吃在地美食</div>
<div class="tag">美食</div>
</div>
</a>

</div>
</div>

<!-- Day 2 -->
<div class="day">
<h2>Day 2：甘川文化村</h2>

<div class="grid">

<a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=甘川文化村" target="_blank">
<img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?colorful,village">
<div class="card-content">
<div class="title">📸 甘川文化村</div>
<div>拍照天堂</div>
<div class="tag">景點</div>
</div>
</a>

<a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=南浦洞" target="_blank">
<img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?shopping,street">
<div class="card-content">
<div class="title">🛍️ 南浦洞</div>
<div>逛街買東西</div>
<div class="tag">購物</div>
</div>
</a>

</div>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
